flowchart TB
    A[Inbound getQuote request] --> B[SQL Task: lookup company by symbol]
    B --> C{Decision: company found?}
    C -->|Yes| D[Log company_id]
    D --> E[HTTP.Request Task\ncall SimpleStockQuoteService]
    E --> F[Return response]
    C -->|No| G[Log: Unrecognized Company ID]
    G --> H[Return SOAP fault: Unrecognized Company ID]

    B -.->|unhandled technical error| I[Process default error handler\nReturn generic Receiver fault]
